# Cut from Wave VII, Intro Focus 23 (CD1-2). The tape passes through Focus 22
# on its way from 21 to 23 and supplies an actual transition body, even though
# Library.sourceCoverage misses word-number mentions such as "focus twenty-one".

@segment    climb-f21-f22
@title      Climb — Focus 21 to Focus 22
@levels     F22
@from       F21
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 22
@duration   ~50s

say You will move beyond Focus 21 as I count.
pause 4
level F22
say Twenty-two.
pause 5
say You are changing. Less aware of time and space, and more aware of this other state.
pause 6
say So close to time and space, but not part of it.
pause 6
say Focus 22. Relax, and remain calm, serene, and sure. You and your consciousness are in full control.
pause 8
